    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/c0c5416ae62dabc288e5d017646cd4af.avif?t=1751515009\" data-has-big width=800 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this minimalist strategy game you'll take command of an army fort, tasked with defending it at all costs. To succeed, you'll need to expand your base and train soldiers to stand by your side in defense of the flag.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/0c800da4e415915979df04ed4a07c72f.poster.avif?t=1751515009\" width=800 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/0c800da4e415915979df04ed4a07c72f.webm?t=1751515009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/0c800da4e415915979df04ed4a07c72f.mp4?t=1751515009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/680d1f13961bb51c600197d17fb70b34.avif?t=1751515009\" data-has-big width=800 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animals will be a highly valuable resource, enabling you to grow your economy and expand further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/9423813729369b4935f7f01b39b40bce.poster.avif?t=1751515009\" width=800 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/9423813729369b4935f7f01b39b40bce.webm?t=1751515009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/9423813729369b4935f7f01b39b40bce.mp4?t=1751515009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/680d1f13961bb51c600197d17fb70b34.avif?t=1751515009\" data-has-big width=800 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll also have the option to choose the opposing side, establishing your own indigenous settlement and becoming the leader of your people, guiding them in resistance against the <i>huinca</i> invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/bdf425f4f81d26fba6906ed9a865fc9f.avif?t=1751515009\" data-has-big width=800 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/680d1f13961bb51c600197d17fb70b34.avif?t=1751515009\" data-has-big width=800 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both sides feature their own campaign, as well as an infinite survival mode where you can test your skills against endless waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/7461ef4908d76c658e0cb6040e684b85.poster.avif?t=1751515009\" width=800 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/7461ef4908d76c658e0cb6040e684b85.webm?t=1751515009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/7461ef4908d76c658e0cb6040e684b85.mp4?t=1751515009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/c0c5416ae62dabc288e5d017646cd4af.avif?t=1751515009\" data-has-big width=800 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this minimalist strategy game you'll take command of an army fort, tasked with defending it at all costs. To succeed, you'll need to expand your base and train soldiers to stand by your side in defense of the flag.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/0c800da4e415915979df04ed4a07c72f.poster.avif?t=1751515009\" width=800 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/0c800da4e415915979df04ed4a07c72f.webm?t=1751515009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/0c800da4e415915979df04ed4a07c72f.mp4?t=1751515009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/680d1f13961bb51c600197d17fb70b34.avif?t=1751515009\" data-has-big width=800 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animals will be a highly valuable resource, enabling you to grow your economy and expand further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/9423813729369b4935f7f01b39b40bce.poster.avif?t=1751515009\" width=800 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/9423813729369b4935f7f01b39b40bce.webm?t=1751515009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/9423813729369b4935f7f01b39b40bce.mp4?t=1751515009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/680d1f13961bb51c600197d17fb70b34.avif?t=1751515009\" data-has-big width=800 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll also have the option to choose the opposing side, establishing your own indigenous settlement and becoming the leader of your people, guiding them in resistance against the <i>huinca</i> invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/bdf425f4f81d26fba6906ed9a865fc9f.avif?t=1751515009\" data-has-big width=800 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/680d1f13961bb51c600197d17fb70b34.avif?t=1751515009\" data-has-big width=800 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both sides feature their own campaign, as well as an infinite survival mode where you can test your skills against endless waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/7461ef4908d76c658e0cb6040e684b85.poster.avif?t=1751515009\" width=800 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/7461ef4908d76c658e0cb6040e684b85.webm?t=1751515009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/7461ef4908d76c658e0cb6040e684b85.mp4?t=1751515009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "From the plains in the Pampas to the most hostile places in the untamed Patagonia: Manage your own frontier fort or native settlement, build new structures, train soldiers, and survive relentless attacks from the enemy.",
